  "parity": "Party-target roster refreshes keep the existing damage trail when the same readable unit and health sample remain current. Sixty modeled roster batches that change one of four targets reduce trail resets from 240 to 60 and hide calls from 1,440 to 360. With all four targets unchanged those counts fall to zero. Main health and color paint remain current. Replacements use their existing fresh identity read after reset, including one extra GUID read when the replacement has the same health. Desktop elapsed gains are small and vary by scenario.",
